  {
    "hotel_id": "782060",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/step-inn-myeongdong-1/hotel/seoul-kr.html",
    "name": "STEP INN Myeongdong 1",
    "detail": "The location is great and so convenient, it was at the very heart of Myeongdong area where you can find all the skin care products that you wanted. Very near to subway and airport bus stop. Street foods are just a step away when you go down at night. The Cathedral is just around the corner. The staff are very friendly and polite. It was raining and it was so cold outside when we arrived midnight at the hotel. Giving credit to Belix who assist us for easy check-in and offer coffee to warm us. The room is clean and comfortable with the full view of Myeongdong street. Good breakfast is available from 7-10am. Mr. Lee, the Manager, was very accomodating, so helpful that he offer us umbrella during that rainy day. He's friendly and very well converse in english. This hotel is very affordable and i will highly recommend this to our friends and other family members. I will definitely stay here again once i go back to Seoul, South Korea again. Thank you, i have a great stay in South Korea.",
